        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "Graduation Notice  \n\nHello everyone. As of today, I am graduating and ceasing all VTubing activities.I have already stepped away from calling myself a VTuber, but continuing to use a model made that distinction feel empty. Using a digital avatar is virtual YouTubing. The label and the practice are the same thing, and I no longer want to participate in it.I started this because my body made other options difficult. Seizures, narcolepsy, frequent migraines, spinal and rib injuries from my time in the military, myoclonus, and POTS have limited what I can physically do. Some days I need a cane. Standing or lying down too quickly can make me pass out or become violently ill. Sleep takes hours and requires heavy medication. Bright lights, loud environments, and long drives can trigger problems, gaming has become more difficult recently as the screen itself has become a trigger. Streaming from home with an avatar was one of the few ways I could still talk to people and play games without leaving the house. Over time the space itself became another weight. There is constant pressure to stay in a narrow, inoffensive lane. Deviate, have opinions, or simply exist as a person behind the model and the reception changes. I am tired of walking on eggshells. I am tired of the way an anime or cartoon avatar immediately lowers how seriously some people take you. I am tired of the culture around it. This is not a pause or a rebrand. After this video I will keep playing Arknights on the purple site with no model until the main story is finished. When that is done, the channel goes dark.  I appreciate the time you spent here.Take care of yourselves.\n\n Ryoko Panic"
        },
